					"content": "「法爾伽，我，名字的意義…已經知道了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雷澤"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111104,
					"content": "「…給大家添了這麼多麻煩，等回來，要好好道謝啊。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘿莎莉亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111105,
					"content": "「喲，雖然有很多事想報告，不過嘛…回來了就好。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111106,
					"content": "「我不打算回騎士團，所以…還是請您自己撐著吧。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪盧克"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111107,
					"content": "「…大團長，我們都在等您。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111108,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111109,
					"content": "嗯？…呵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111110,
					"content": "我這大團長，當得應該還不賴吧？…各位。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111111,
					"content": "…那我就當你們是默認囉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111112,
					"content": "你們那時誓死拯救下來的事物…現在也都好好地在那裡呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111113,
					"content": "嗯，騎士團、蒙德…還有騎士的誓言，我都會守護好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111114,
					"content": "所以…那封信，我會替你們送到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111115,
					"content": "…雖然只是「他」的倒影，但還有空的話，就替「他」讀一讀吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111116,
					"content": "魯斯坦和艾倫德林，都沒忘記過你——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111117,
					"content": "哈…這一趟走得還真遠啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111118,
					"content": "剩下的就…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111119,
					"content": "…「聽憑風引」吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111122,
					"content": "……！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "諾艾爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111130,
					"content": "…喲，好久不見，諸位。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111131,
					"content": "#…能再見到{F#妳}{M#你}們，真是太好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法爾伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 160111132,
					"content": "歡迎凱旋——大團長。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160111133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 160111133,
					"content": "…嗯，我回來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
